## 1. 3D CubeSat Design Studio Implementation

### Features & Architecture
- **Interactive Three.js 3D Viewport ([`CubeSatCanvas.jsx`](file:///C:/Users/RH364/OneDrive/Desktop/orbital%20desktop/OrbitalX/frontend/src/pages/studio/CubeSatCanvas.jsx))**:
  - Customizable 1U, 2U, and 3U aluminum aerospace-grade chassis with golden deployer rails, separation spring standoffs, and mounting racks.
  - 3D physical modules rendered dynamically inside and on the exterior of the chassis:
    - **Solar Panels**: Triple-junction GaAs solar cell arrays with reflective busbars mounted to side faces.
    - **OBC Core**: PC104 board with glowing green status LEDs and microcontrollers.
    - **Battery Pack**: Dual/quad Li-Ion cell block with warning labels.
    - **Deployable Antenna**: Spring-loaded gold whip dipole rods extending outward.
    - **Reaction Wheel**: Brass ADCS flywheel cylinder mounted in an aluminum gimbal.
    - **Camera Lens**: Optical telescope barrel facing Nadir.
  - **Assembly Mode (`ASSEMBLE`)**: Toggles exploded component views and locks parts smoothly into the primary chassis rails.
  - **Validation Mode (`VALIDATE`)**: Sweeps a luminous cyan telemetry laser scan line vertically through the satellite.
  - OrbitControls support (drag to rotate, scroll to zoom, right-click to pan) with auto-rotate toggle (`Rotating` / `Paused`).
  - Holographic empty state overlay when 0 components are mounted.

- **Component Library Drawer ([`cubesatComponents.js`](file:///C:/Users/RH364/OneDrive/Desktop/orbital%20desktop/OrbitalX/frontend/src/pages/studio/cubesatComponents.js))**:
  - Search input with clear button and 7 category filters (`ALL`, `Structure`, `Power`, `Avionics`, `Comms`, `Payload`, `Sensors`).
  - Cards displaying unit mass (g), volume (U), power consumption/generation (W), unit cost ($), and limit badges (e.g. `Max (1/1)`).

- **Mission Budget & Real-Time Diagnostics ([`CubeSatStudio.jsx`](file:///C:/Users/RH364/OneDrive/Desktop/orbital%20desktop/OrbitalX/frontend/src/pages/studio/CubeSatStudio.jsx))**:
  - Progress gauges with dynamic color transitions (Cyan -> Yellow -> Red) for **Mass**, **Volume**, **Power**, and **Thermal**.
  - Financial & mission summary metrics: Total Cost ($), Battery Runtime in shadow eclipse, and Total Parts mounted.
  - Subsystem Status flags: `COMMS`, `ADCS`, `EPS` (`OK` / `WARN` / `MISSING`).
  - Real-time rule-checking diagnostics feed: detects missing OBC, power deficits, communication link losses, or certifies launch readiness.

- **Bill of Materials (BOM) View**:
  - Viewport mode switch between `3D Viewport` and `List` view for a detailed itemized breakdown of costs, subsystems, quantities, and removal controls.

- **Navigation & Routing**:
  - Added `3D Studio` to sidebar navigation in [`DashboardLayout.jsx`](file:///C:/Users/RH364/OneDrive/Desktop/orbital%20desktop/OrbitalX/frontend/src/components/layout/DashboardLayout.jsx) and registered `/studio` in [`App.jsx`](file:///C:/Users/RH364/OneDrive/Desktop/orbital%20desktop/OrbitalX/frontend/src/App.jsx).

